# Purpose
Explain the replacement 12:14 guest tour through six transcript-derived chapters,
including safe demo Send behavior and the explicit handoff to a real request.

# Dependencies
- ../videos/index.json: greatvibe-welcome.
- ../videos/transcripts/greatvibe-welcome.md and original VTT.
- ../getting-started/ask-mochi-for-help.md and current task/reference guides.

# Gotchas
Recorded free-trial, retention and security statements do not override current
policy. Do not imply guest mid-turn steering or durable Mochi files. The mobile
tutorial is optional learning and must not replace or extend the guest demo.

# Change History
- 2026-10-15: Add transcript-grounded guest walkthrough and agent answer routing.
